Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.44,0:00:03.40,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Aqui é a Spe e...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.38,Black,Oguri Cap,0,0,0,,...a Oguri...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.38,0:00:07.07,Black,Spe / Oguri,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\c&H000000&\t(2043,2376,1,\blur3)}...e o Uma Uma Kitchen!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.38,0:00:07.07,Black,Spe / Oguri,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(0,300)\4a&HFF&\t(2043,2376,1,\blur3)}...e o Uma Uma Kitchen!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.11,0:00:11.12,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,E a assistente delas, Matikanetannhauser!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.12,0:00:14.54,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Chefes, o que vamos cozinhar hoje?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.87,0:00:17.54,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Vamos cozinhar hambúrguer com cenoura!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:19.09,0:00:20.95,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Sem mais delongas,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.95,0:00:22.08,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Ei! Ei!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.08,0:00:23.88,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,{\t(1526,1818,1,\c&H000000&)}— Ooh!\NMun!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.55,0:00:27.02,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Primeiro, misture a carne.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:27.02,0:00:31.77,Black,Oguri Cap,0,0,0,,Um quilo de carne moída, uma colher de sopa de sal, Panko e ovos...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.74,0:00:35.35,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Está tomando forma!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:35.35,0:00:37.43,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Bom, hora de cozinhar!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.77,0:00:41.39,Black,Oguri Cap,0,0,0,,Dê uma boa dourada nos dois lados e abafe.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.39,0:00:43.86,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Ué? Cadê o óleo?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:44.15,0:00:47.30,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Oguri, poderia me trazer o óleo?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.24,Black,Oguri Cap,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:48.62,0:00:50.03,Black,Oguri Cap,0,0,0,,Óleo, óleo...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.39,0:00:59.91,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Que cheiro bom!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:00.26,0:01:04.54,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Spe-chan, o macarrão parece estar pronto.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.54,0:01:07.34,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Oguri, poderia nos trazer alguns pratos, por favor?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:07.34,0:01:08.76,Black,Oguri Cap,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:11.22,0:01:14.55,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Soberbo! Al dente...!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:14.55,0:01:15.35,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Deixa eu experimentar também!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:17.22,0:01:18.27,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Isso é...!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:18.62,0:01:20.97,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,O sabor está expandindo na minha boca...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.97,0:01:22.52,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,...então isto é al dente?!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.52,0:01:26.49,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Gostoso al dente... Gostoso al dente...!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:26.49,0:01:28.69,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,{\t(1973,2223,1,\c&H000000&)}Ei, Spe-chan...!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.09,0:01:31.49,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Terminamos!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:31.86,0:01:33.66,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Muito bem!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.35,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,E-este aqui ficou meio feio, então eu vou comer ele...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.62,0:01:44.21,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Esta textura macia e fofa, combinada com os sucos da carne...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:44.21,0:01:46.44,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Muito delicioso!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:46.89,0:01:51.25,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,...Está tão bom assim? A-agora que estou vendo, esta parte também...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:51.25,0:01:54.66,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Uau! Que gostoso!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:55.68,0:01:57.66,Black,Everyone,0,0,0,,E aqui, aqui também!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.54,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,A gente fez de novo!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:01.54,0:02:02.79,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:03.64,0:02:06.02,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Eu preparei alguns mais cedos! Estão bem...
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.02,0:02:07.27,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Aqui!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:07.27,0:02:10.02,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,...Ué?! Sumiram!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.02,0:02:12.32,Black,Oguri Cap,0,0,0,,P-parecia que eu podia comer eles...
Dialogue: 4,0:02:12.32,0:02:14.49,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,O-o-o-o-o-o-o que a gente faz agora?!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:14.49,0:02:15.87,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Não se preocupem!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.61,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Bom, vamos encerrar por aqui.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.61,0:02:25.80,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Este foi o Uma Uma Kitchen!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.04,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Tchau, tchau!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:27.64,0:02:30.13,Black,Oguri Cap,0,0,0,,Da próxima vez, que tal Mapo Tofu?
Comment: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:31.26,Black,Comment,0,0,0,,-- ED THEME STARTS --
